  title: Day 1
  text: "Evil spirits have been spotted in this house, taking possession of the guests\u2019
    bodies... Watch out for the red masks, they seem extremely aggressive toward
    strangers. Be careful not to hurt too many innocent people : they might not take
    it very well. Survive for 4 days and you\u2019ll receive your payment. Good luck!"
